Rust-backed Rofi integration against 6d2a5281e45dee92dfbdaf6f9ba6081c4c608682.

Preserve stable selection callbacks, the selected item during filtering,
per-mode refresh/initial selection, and opt-in Wayland keyboard focus sharing.
These are the existing four patches consolidated without behaviour changes.

